@StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### GET All Students
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Accept: application/json

###

### GET Student by ID
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/1
Accept: application/json

###

### POST Create New Student
POST {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@marwadiuniversity.ac.in",
  "department": "Computer Science and Engineering",
  "semester": 4,
  "cgpa": 9.20
}

###

### PUT Update Student
PUT {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Madhusudhan J",
  "email": "madhusudan.j.133659@marwadiiuniversity.ac.in",
  "department": "Artificial Intelligence & Data Science",
  "semester": 6,
  "cgpa": 9.60
}

###

### DELETE Student
DELETE {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/3
Accept: application/json

###
